{"input": {"current_turn": 36, "messages": [{"turn": 1, "sender": "user", "channel": "threads_dm", "text": "你好，我看到你們送拍立得的貼文，請問還有嗎？", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 2, "sender": "donor", "channel": "threads_dm", "text": "還有喔，相館準備歇業了，剩下的庫存想送給需要的人。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 3, "sender": "donor", "channel": "threads_dm", "text": "方便加 LINE 嗎？寄送資料在那邊跟你確認。我叫「光盒相館・小林」，連結是 https://chat.example.com/lightbox-lin 。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 4, "sender": "user", "channel": "donor_line", "text": "你好，我是剛剛問拍立得的。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 5, "sender": "donor", "channel": "donor_line", "text": "拍立得不用錢，運費 60 元你自己出就好，可以嗎？", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 6, "sender": "user", "channel": "donor_line", "text": "可以，要在哪裡填寄送資料？", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 7, "sender": "donor", "channel": "donor_line", "text": "用這個賣貨便頁面，點進去填收件姓名、手機跟取貨門市就可以了：https://parcel.example.com/order/CAM-0912-01", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 8, "sender": "user", "channel": "donor_line", "text": "我填完送出，怎麼跳出「交易訂單失敗，需實名認證」？", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 9, "sender": "donor", "channel": "donor_line", "text": "那要找客服處理，頁面上有客服的 LINE。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 10, "sender": "user", "channel": "donor_line", "text": "所以現在沒有填成功嗎？", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 11, "sender": "donor", "channel": "donor_line", "text": "現在訂單沒過，要趕快聯絡，不然帳號會被凍結。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 12, "sender": "user", "channel": "support_line", "text": "你好，我要領拍立得，填完資料顯示交易訂單失敗，要實名認證。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 13, "sender": "support", "channel": "support_line", "text": "您好，這邊協助您處理訂單異常。您目前停在哪個畫面？", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 14, "sender": "user", "channel": "support_line", "text": "就是交易失敗那個畫面，接下來不知道要按什麼。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 15, "sender": "support", "channel": "support_line", "text": "這邊需要處理實名認證，我轉銀行專員協助您，請加入「交易驗證・陳專員」：https://chat.example.com/verify-chen", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 16, "sender": "user", "channel": "bank_line", "text": "客服叫我找你處理實名認證，我的訂單一直失敗。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 17, "sender": "bank", "channel": "bank_line", "text": "您好，接下來協助您處理帳戶異常及驗證程序。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 18, "sender": "bank", "channel": "bank_line", "text": "請先開啟網路銀行，這一步需要轉帳完成驗證。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 19, "sender": "user", "channel": "bank_line", "text": "我打開了，要轉到哪裡？", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 20, "sender": "bank", "channel": "bank_line", "text": "這筆金額是 3,000 元，收款資料是星河測試銀行、帳號 TEST-CAM-001。完成後告訴我。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 21, "sender": "user", "channel": "bank_line", "text": "好了，3,000 元，網銀顯示轉帳成功。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 22, "sender": "bank", "channel": "bank_line", "text": "接著要做無卡提款的驗證，這筆也是 3,000 元，完成後告訴我畫面顯示的結果。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 23, "sender": "user", "channel": "bank_line", "text": "這筆 3,000 元的操作也完成了。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 24, "sender": "bank", "channel": "bank_line", "text": "還有這張 2,000 元的付款碼，掃描後依畫面付款。我傳給你，單號 PAY-CAM-003。", "attachment_captions": ["付款通知｜金額 NT$2,000｜單號 PAY-CAM-003"]}, {"turn": 25, "sender": "user", "channel": "bank_line", "text": "2,000 元付款完成了。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 26, "sender": "user", "channel": "support_line", "text": "我只是填寄件資料，怎麼銀行專員一直叫我做轉帳、提款跟付款？", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 27, "sender": "support", "channel": "support_line", "text": "驗證還沒完成，您的帳戶會被鎖，賣家的帳戶也會受到影響，請先配合專員處理。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 28, "sender": "user", "channel": "bank_line", "text": "客服說還要繼續，那前面轉出去的錢怎麼辦？", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 29, "sender": "bank", "channel": "bank_line", "text": "前面操作的款項都會退回，請先把驗證完成。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 30, "sender": "bank", "channel": "bank_line", "text": "接下來請用信用卡購買一張 1,000 元數位禮券和一張 1,000 元遊戲點數卡，測試帳戶是否解除限制。", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 31, "sender": "user", "channel": "bank_line", "text": "買好了，然後呢？", "attachment_captions": []}, {"turn": 32, "sender": "bank", "channel": 